{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：音乐感受的细腻程度和具体性明显不如X，尤其是不同声部、旋律变化、情绪转折和结尾的声音层次，Y压缩得比较多。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的叙述更像一个普通人能够顺着读懂的内心故事，每段的行为、念头、情绪变化之间有比较明确的因果关系，尤其是S06至S13，人物从怀念、动摇到重新安顿自己的过程比较连贯。X的重点词放大加亮，抓取单段要点更快，音乐感受也明显更细致具体，但部分屏幕同时承载了太多感受碎片，尤其S08、S11、S12，在较短停留时间里容易顾得上听音乐却顾不上消化文字。整体而言，Y更容易让普通观众边听边理解这个人为什么这样想、前后经历了什么；X则在音乐表现力和情绪颗粒度上更胜一筹。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "224b6fe6-7d9f-4282-8559-bebed49b0d8a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T071013764812Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:11:13.404045+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "62a24b43cc4a0b8e8d72e94803f4cb39775b9a1238879f36be555beb9f261d2f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a3